<main class="about-main">
    <div class="about-staggered-title">
        <h1 class="about-big-title">
            <span class="big-title-top">关</span>
            <span class="big-title-mid">于</span>
            <span class="big-title-bot">我</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="about-title-accent">
            <span class="accent-line"></span>
            <span class="accent-text">ABOUT</span>
            <span class="accent-line"></span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content-grid">
        <div class="about-visual-column">
            <div class="avatar-liquid-container">
                <div class="avatar-liquid-ring"></div>
                <div class="avatar-liquid-core">
                    <i class="fas fa-user-astronaut"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="avatar-orbits">
                    <div class="orbit orbit-1"></div>
                    <div class="orbit orbit-2"></div>
                    <div class="orbit orbit-3"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="social-pills">
                <a href="#" class="btn-glass social-pill"><i class="fab fa-github"></i> GitHub</a>
                <a href="#" class="btn-glass social-pill"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i> Twitter</a>
                <a href="#" class="btn-glass social-pill"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i> LinkedIn</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-text-column">
            <div class="text-card glass-card shift-right">
                <h3>一位热爱技术的创作者</h3>
                <p>你好！我是一名全栈开发者与独立创作者，热衷于探索前沿技术、构建优雅的数字产品。我相信技术与艺术的结合能创造无限可能。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-card glass-card shift-left">
                <p>过去几年中，我参与了多个大型 Web 应用项目，涵盖电商、社交平台和数据可视化等领域。同时，我也在这个博客上分享我的学习心得、项目经验与生活感悟。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="stats-staggered">
                <div class="stat-card-glass">
                    <span class="stat-num-glitch" data-target="50">0</span>
                    <span class="stat-label-glass">+ 文章</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card-glass stat-offset">
                    <span class="stat-num-glitch" data-target="30">0</span>
                    <span class="stat-label-glass">+ 项目</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card-glass">
                    <span class="stat-num-glitch" data-target="5">0</span>
                    <span class="stat-label-glass">年经验</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="skills-constellation">
        <h3 class="skills-constellation-title">
            <span class="title-deco-left">◆</span>
            我的技能
            <span class="title-deco-right">◆</span>
        </h3>
        <div class="constellation-map">
            <div class="skill-node" style="--node-x: 10%; --node-y: 15%;">
                <div class="node-core"><i class="fab fa-vuejs"></i></div>
                <span class="node-label">Vue.js</span>
                <div class="node-glow-bar" style="--fill: 90%;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-node" style="--node-x: 45%; --node-y: 5%;">
                <div class="node-core"><i class="fab fa-react"></i></div>
                <span class="node-label">React</span>
                <div class="node-glow-bar" style="--fill: 85%;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-node" style="--node-x: 78%; --node-y: 20%;">
                <div class="node-core"><i class="fab fa-node-js"></i></div>
                <span class="node-label">Node.js</span>
                <div class="node-glow-bar" style="--fill: 88%;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-node" style="--node-x: 15%; --node-y: 55%;">
                <div class="node-core"><i class="fab fa-python"></i></div>
                <span class="node-label">Python</span>
                <div class="node-glow-bar" style="--fill: 75%;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-node" style="--node-x: 55%; --node-y: 50%;">
                <div class="node-core"><i class="fas fa-database"></i></div>
                <span class="node-label">数据库</span>
                <div class="node-glow-bar" style="--fill: 80%;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-node" style="--node-x: 85%; --node-y: 60%;">
                <div class="node-core"><i class="fab fa-docker"></i></div>
                <span class="node-label">Docker</span>
                <div class="node-glow-bar" style="--fill: 70%;"></div>
            </div>
            <svg class="constellation-lines" viewBox="0 0 100 70" preserveAspectRatio="none">
                <line x1="13" y1="18" x2="47" y2="8" stroke="rgba(102,126,234,0.2)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <line x1="47" y1="8" x2="80" y2="23" stroke="rgba(102,126,234,0.2)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <line x1="13" y1="18" x2="18" y2="58" stroke="rgba(240,147,251,0.2)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <line x1="18" y1="58" x2="58" y2="53" stroke="rgba(240,147,251,0.2)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <line x1="58" y1="53" x2="87" y2="63" stroke="rgba(240,147,251,0.2)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <line x1="80" y1="23" x2="87" y2="63" stroke="rgba(102,126,234,0.2)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
            </svg>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>